1580	        // CR 119.3 + CR 702.15b: defer lifelink to a single per-source life-gain
1581	        // after the whole simultaneous batch is applied. A source dealing combat
1582	        // damage to several recipients at once (multiple blockers, trample to a
1583	        // blocker + the player, etc.) gains life ONCE for the total — so a
1584	        // "whenever you gain life" trigger fires once, not once per target.
1585	        let lifelink_controller = if ctx.has_lifelink {
